   \n            <div>Featured Products</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"https://lumax.streamx.com/_fragments/collected:products:featured-by-category:featured.tiles.html\">https://lumax.streamx.com/_fragments/collected:products:featured-by-category:featured.tiles.html</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>product-listing--horizontal</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n"}}}}{"key":"/content/psg-demo-ue/women-hoodies.html","action":"publish","eventTime":{"long":1746199600230},"properties":{"sx:type":"/libs/core/franklin/templates/page"},"payload":{"dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Page":{"content":{"bytes":"\n\n\n<div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/women.webp\" alt=\"Women&amp;#39;s Sportswear\"></picture></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><h1>Women's Sportswear</h1>\n<p>Discover our collection of high-performance sportswear designed specifically for women. From training to leisure, find your perfect fit.</p></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>full</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>400</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n    <h2>Shop By Category</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"category-cards\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/model-yellow-clothing.webp\"></picture></div>\n        \n            <div>Pants</div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"/women-pants\">/women-pants</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/woman-shorts.webp\"></picture></div>\n        \n            <div>Shorts</div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"/women-shorts\">/women-shorts</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/bra.webp\"></picture></div>\n        \n            <div>Bras and Tanks</div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"/bras-and-tanks\">/bras-and-tanks</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/model-yellow-clothing.webp\"></picture></div>\n        \n            <div>Hoodies and Sweatshirts</div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"/women-hoodies\">/women-hoodies</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n"}}}}{"key":"/content/psg-demo-ue/lifestyle/nutrition.html","action":"publish","eventTime":{"long":1746199603355},"properties":{"sx:type":"/libs/core/franklin/templates/page"},"payload":{"dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Page":{"content":{"bytes":"\n\n\n<div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/dish.webp\" alt=\"Dish\"></picture></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><h2>Achive Your Personal Best</h2></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>narrow</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>400</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Nutrition</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>highlight</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n    <p>What you put into your body directly affects your athletic performance.</p>\n<p>Learn how to fuel your workouts and recovery with the right nutrients.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Proper nutrition timing is crucial for both performance and recovery.</p>\n<p>Understanding when to eat certain nutrients can make a significant</p>\n<p>difference in your results.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Key nutrition principles:</p>\n<p>1. Eat adequate protein for muscle recovery</p>\n<p>2. Time your carbohydrates around workouts</p>\n<p>3. Stay hydrated throughout the day</p>\n<p>4. Include healthy fats for hormone production</p>\n<p>5. Consider supplementation when necessary</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"key-takeaways\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>Timing your nutrients is as important as what you eat</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Protein intake directly impacts muscle recovery and growth</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Balanced macronutrients optimize athletic performance</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>flex-two-columns</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n"}}}}{"key":"/content/psg-demo-ue/lifestyle/mental.html","action":"publish","eventTime":{"long":1746199604272},"properties":{"sx:type":"/libs/core/franklin/templates/page"},"payload":{"dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Page":{"content":{"bytes":"\n\n\n<div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/psg-demo-ue/mentalhealth.webp\" alt=\"Mental Health\"></picture></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><h2>Unlock the Mind, Spirit, and Body</h2></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>full</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>500</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Mental Health</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>highlight</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n    <p>Improving mental health is a valuable pursuit that can enhance overall well-being, and there are several practical steps one can take to achieve it.</p>\n<ol>\n <li>First, practicing regular physical exercise, such as a 30-minute walk or yoga session, can boost mood by releasing endorphins, reducing stress, and improving sleep quality.</li>\n <li>&nbsp;</li>\n <li>Second, cultivating a mindfulness or meditation habitâspending even just 10 minutes a day focusing on breathing or grounding oneself in the present momentâcan help manage anxiety and foster emotional resilience.</li>\n <li>&nbsp;</li>\n <li>Finally, building strong social connections, like scheduling regular catch-ups with friends or family, provides a support network that combats loneliness and offers perspective during tough times. Together, these habits can create a solid foundation for a healthier mind.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"key-takeaways\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>Prayer is Essential</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Meditation is Key</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Physical Exercise is Required</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>flex-two-columns</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n"}}}}{"key":"/content/psg-demo-ue/lifestyle/wellness.html","action":"publish","eventTime":{"long":1746199606835},"properties":{"sx:type":"/libs/core/franklin/templates/page"},"payload":{"dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Page":{"content":{"bytes":"\n\n\n<div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><picture><img src=\"/content/dam/wknd-shared/en/activities/camping/camp-summer-night.webp\" alt=\"Weight Lifter\"></picture></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div><h2>The Ultimate Guide to Sport Recovery</h2></div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>full</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>400</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Wellness</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n    <p>Recovery is just as important as the workout itself. In this comprehensive guide,</p>\n<p>we'll explore the latest techniques and strategies for optimal athletic recovery.</p>\n<p>Getting adequate rest and proper nutrition are key components of any recovery routine.</p>\n<p>Studies show that athletes who prioritize recovery see better performance gains and</p>\n<p>reduced risk of injury.</p>\n<p>Here are some key recovery strategies:</p>\n<p>1. Get 7-9 hours of quality sleep</p>\n<p>2. Stay hydrated throughout the day</p>\n<p>3. Incorporate active recovery sessions</p>\n<p>4. Use foam rolling and stretching</p>\n<p>5. Consider cold therapy or ice baths</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"key-takeaways\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>Quality sleep is the foundation of athletic recovery</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Proper hydration enhances muscle repair and reduces soreness</div>\n        \n    </div>\n<div>\n        \n            <div>Active recovery techniques are more effective than complete rest</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div>style</div>\n        \n            <div>flex-two-columns</div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"fragment\">\n    <div>\n        \n            <div><a href=\"/content/experience-fragments/perficient-lumax-aem/us/en/lumax-special-offer--target-/master.html\">/content/experience-fragments/perficient-lumax-aem/us/en/lumax-special-offer--target-/master</a></div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n    \n\n<div class=\"section-metadata\">\n    \n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n"}}}}